  "steps": [
    "Add 1tsp jeera, 4-5 cloves of garlic, ginger and green chillies.",
    "Sauté for a min and add 2-3 tbsp chopped onions. Cook for 2 mins and add 5-6 chunks of boiled beetroot. Add the masalas: 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, 1/2 tsp garam masala, pinch of haldi, salt, black salt, 1/4 tsp pepper, 1/2 tsp coriander powder, 1 tsp aamchur. Mix well and add a dash of water. Cover and cook for 5 minutes. Lastly add 1 tbsp rice flour and mix.",
    "Boil 30g of soya chunks and squeeze out the excess water very well.",
    "In a blender, add the beetroot masala, soya chunks, half whole wheat bread, 50g low fat paneer.",
    "Keep the paste in the fridge for 30 mins.",
    "Take 1 cube of cheese (amul/britania) and cut 10-12 small squares.",
    "Apply oil on your palms and roll out kebabs and stuff 1-2 cubes in each kebab.",
    "Brush a non stick pan with ghee and add the kebabs. Cook on both sides on low flame for 15 minutes until golden brown on both sides."
  ],
